{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/e1c98f5764c37defb0e14d26f2db9ec6.avif?t=1763938808\" width=900 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister\u2019s been kidnapped. The criminals want ransom, and the clock is already ticking. All you have is your wits, a computer, and the Silicon Sneaky OS at your fingertips. How you raise the money\u2014and what paths you take to get there\u2014are entirely up to you. Every choice carries weight, every action burns time, and every decision could bring you closer to saving her\u2026 or uncovering secrets you were never meant to find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/55fc70331e9ced5256e8248c8a067a09.avif?t=1763938808\" width=900 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through your terminal to earn money before time runs out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to make your cash\u2014whether through risky shortcuts or steady grinding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new skills from a branching skill tree and tailor your strategy with each playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path: with six possible endings, no two runs are the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But remember\u2014they got their eyes are on you, and every second wasted brings your sister closer to being lost forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/7e101caa882ea9e4bbd69e4af2cc535d.avif?t=1763938808\" width=900 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapta stands out with its minimalist 2-color pixel art style. Every terminal windows on the Silicon Sneaky OS is built from a single base color and a sharp highlight, creating a clean, high-contrast look. You can swap palettes\u2014neon green/black, icy blue/white, and more\u2014to make Silicon Sneaky feel uniquely yours. Simple, striking, and instantly recognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MAIN ENDING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/72042ec5941b6cba6f95f49995ab5c9c361f50c7.jpg"},{"name":"ENDING 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/3b612ee36f17f33b3b35952a6b8ec72585311556.jpg"},{"name":"ENDING 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/7a4d2038479368da6bb3e1e8837818fd49d8ade9.jpg"},{"name":"ENDING 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/a277e41b80c4bb8c7440e1eeb38f7812472c5394.jpg"},{"name":"ENDING 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/97aa4893008570a1351d957f1df81982d3290be6.jpg"},{"name":"ENDING 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/b8c4a7aa1960a788758aac8dd2475d7c53288f63.jpg"},{"name":"PONG!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/b1a67d016580b40af7ed4427269e5559058b80fa.jpg"},{"name":"COP OR PIG?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/634577680a1663bc302f39bf015574bcbacb162a.jpg"},{"name":"ALL ENDINGS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/e92e77b7f713e06cad56191f313c87874e7df938.jpg"},{"name":"ETHICAL HACKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944670/d8a25b1600c86d9a8621650d8f7e7b859ec98022.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944670?t=1